_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ANDg7i3nKrUQ7kNvwGR4KJI&_nc_oc=Adr1PyzNOYuHw9bTaOafnWMBY5_iCnydr2S1DyCJndb9E7GW0BSU55O-orzjn3Fq_KY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af2JFwH534ZSmdLZMFfF7WTsAUyMda19INusWjPtlzQnbA&oe=69F20EFC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Insight Meditation", "keywords": ["meditation", "mindfulness", "vr", "yoga", "insight"], "long_description": "Discover the power of mindfulness with Insight Meditation VR, your gateway to deep relaxation and inner peace. Designed for both beginners and experienced meditators, this app offers a fully immersive meditation experience in breathtaking virtual environments.\n\nKey Features:\n\u2705 Immersive VR Meditation: Escape into serene nature, space, and artistic landscapes.\n\u2705 Guided & Silent Sessions: Choose from expert-led meditations or enjoy quiet contemplation.\n\u2705 Breath Visualization: Enhance your mindfulness with interactive breathwork.\n\u2705 Soothing Soundscapes: Relax with calming music and natural ambiance.\n\u2705 Free & Pro Content: Access 15 free meditations or unlock 50+ premium sessions with regular updates.\n\nStep into a world of tranquility and transform your meditation practice with Insight Meditation VR. Download now and begin your journey to mindfulness.", "short_description": "Immerse yourself in deep relaxation with Insight Meditation VR. Explore stunning virtual landscapes, guided meditations, breath visualizations, and soothing music. Enjoy a free selection of meditative experiences, or unlock the Pro version for an ever-growing library of immersive sessions. Elevate your mindfulness journey with VR-powered serenity."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.termsfeed.com/live/cd85b7ef-d2e3-4561-bd87-9daa694c7eb7", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Alex Azzi", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.facebook.com/share/1FbGzpcXzU/", "category": null, "c